# install.sh sidecar (absolute interpreter path; host-specific)
.runtime-env
# The upstream claude-view release: a ~33 MB server binary plus its prebuilt
# frontend and node sidecar. Reproducible from a pinned tag + recorded
# checksum (see INSTALL.md), so it is fetched/built rather than committed.
vendor/
# Per-service claude-view state: the SQLite index, tantivy segments, and the
# port file. Derived entirely from ~/.claude/projects, so it is disposable.
state/
# TLS leaf minted for the mesh front, and the host-specific extra SANs it is
# cut for (the Windows-side ZeroTier IP). Both are per-host and re-derivable.
.certs/
.sans
